############################################################
# History File (Optional)
############################################################

# Generated at runtime, and no longer even written here: history.c moved
# to a per-user data directory (~/.local/share/calculator, %APPDATA%, or
# the macOS equivalent) precisely so that history survives moving or
# deleting the build folder. The copy that used to sit here was tracked
# until v1.1.1 -- somebody's old calculation history, committed.
Build/history.txt
history.txt

